<title>FRANCE: Aerospatiale, Diehl to cooperate on missile - paper.</title>
<headline>Aerospatiale, Diehl to cooperate on missile - paper.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>France's Aerospatiale and German company Diehl GmbH &amp; Co will probably announce an accord in the missles sector in January, daily La Tribune said on Thursday.</p>
<p>It said the two groups would cooperate on a long-range version of the Multiple Launch Rocket System (MLRS), licensed for production in Europe.</p>
<p>It gave no further details of the reported agreement, which it said would strengthen Diehl's ambition of becoming Germany's leading missile producer.</p>
<p>State-owned Aerospatiale was not available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
